# The repo's canonical text form is LF, enforced at checkout too: no smudge
# boundary between working tree and repository, so byte-level gates (the
# bilingual pairing record's blob hashes, the line-alignment check) see one
# form on every host. Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks the README pair
# out as CRLF and the hashes recorded in README.i18n.yaml no longer match the
# bytes on disk, so a fresh clone reads as a stale pairing record.
* text=auto eol=lf
